  verb: Read
  title: Newspaper clipping
  body: 'AUCTION NOTICE

    The effects of the late Mr S. Kerr (98), once apprenticed to a clockmaker.


    Lot 14: brass pocket watch, maker''s mark ''A. H.''. Ticks, though it holds no spring.


    Sold to an anonymous buyer. Delivery arranged.'
